ht_multiplier 0.0 (issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT, disclosed by both advocates), but no closure or external traffic cause was invoked, so POL-RD-03 and POL-RD-13 are not engaged and no escalation under POL-RD-10(5) arises. POL-RD-09 gives nothing to correct: the fare breakdown itemises no ERP gantries and an airport surcharge of 0.00, so there is no pass-through or billing-integrity line to refund. POL-GEN-03: the present state stands - payment_status remains CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd remains 0.00.",
