on_claims_60d of 0, so no heightened corroboration applies, and the burden under POL-RD-08 fails on the threshold fact regardless. No escalation trigger under POL-RD-10 fires and no clause produces a referral. The present state stands: payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00 are left as they are, and no compensation is owed to the driver (the billed distance matches the trace, so there is no unbilled-distance shortfall)."
